  "sourceTitle": "Egg Gravy",
  "sourceText": "Egg Gravy\nBy: Yuna Wu\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n4 eggs, beaten\n1/2 cup sugar\n1 cup milk\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix together and cook in a skillet, stirring constantly. Great over toast.\n\nAbout\n\n\nMom made it for us. Mom couldn't remember what Grandma called it, we always called it Egg Gravy.",
